{"id":"8d9c15743f7342d2","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-hbl-conditions.md","title":"Hilbert–Bernays–Löb Conditions","display":"df-hbl-conditions — Hilbert–Bernays–Löb Conditions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-hbl-conditions","aliases":["90-df-hbl-conditions"],"display":"df-hbl-conditions — Hilbert–Bernays–Löb Conditions","depends_on":["[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-hbl-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-hbl-conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hbl-conditions — Hilbert–Bernays–Löb Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，固定句子理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、语法编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 及单自由变量公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(P(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span>；推导和代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>此文件定义原先在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7\" href=\"?note=3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7\" title=\"90-cor-henkin-provable\">90-cor-henkin-provable</a> 中使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 可以是已选定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span>，但不能从该名称推定以下条件成立。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 是固定的唯一自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>。三个模式始终代入此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box_P\\sigma\\;:=\\;P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]\\qquad(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box_P\\sigma\\;:=\\;P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]\\qquad(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash\\sigma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\Box_P\\sigma]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash(\\Box_P(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P\\tau))]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash\\sigma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\Box_P\\sigma]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash(\\Box_P(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P\\tau))]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是三个明确的元语言条件／公式模式；第一条含元语言的蕴涵，后两条要求对象理论内的推导。嵌套的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma)\">\\(\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma)\\)</span> 先构造句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]\">\\(P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]\\)</span>，再取该句子的代码和数码，不把内部数码省略。语言、编码及规则都是固定环境参数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAn