L}_T(P)$。$P$ 可以是已选定的 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$，但不能从该名称推定以下条件成立。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 是固定的唯一自由变量；$\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]$ 取 [[90-df-formula]]。三个模式始终代入此 $v$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"P(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_P\\sigma\\;:=\\;P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]\\qquad(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash\\sigma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\Box_P\\sigma]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash(\\Box_P(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\to(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P\\tau))]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\ [T\\vdash(\\Box_P\\sigma\\to\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma))].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box_P(\\Box_P\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"P[\\overline{g(\\sigma)}/v]","display":false}],"bytes":1865,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HBL}_T(\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$ 的原接口现由 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]] 独立定义；它不是藏在某个蕴涵前件中的临时等价式。"},{"id":"76e7fe5e5759a867","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"固定 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]] 中同一个算术扩张签名 $S$、句子理论 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$、有效编码 $g$ 和变量 $v$。$P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]$，数码、替换和可证关系均沿用该环境。"},{"id":"f9a3c4a1ebd2b711","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,S,g,d$ 满足 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)$；$P(v)$、$\\Box_P$、$\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)$ 见 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]]。"},{"id":"7145c12676268ab1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)$ 取本地补齐的 [[90-df-hilbert-bernays]]，保留原二元调用；$P\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}[\\langle v\\rangle]$ 与 [[90-df-hbl-conditions]] 固定同一 $S,g,T,v$。下式重述其与三个 HBL 模式的接口等价，不假定有效公理化自动给出这些模式。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]、[[90-thm-second-incompleteness]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\n[[90-df-haltseq.md]]\n[[90-df-hbl-conditions.md]]\n[[90-df-hen